    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.comment\n\n### Description\n\n> Blueprint uses C-style line comments (// comment for the rest of the line) and block comments (/* multiline comment... */).\r\n\r\nhttps://jwestman.pages.gitlab.gnome.org/blueprint-compiler/reference/index.html",
