        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Yes, the suggested way of defining custom comment structure is by defining custom commentstring per buffer or [`options.custom_commentstring`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/afa6f0a3dc27b910501651f5fc26ef3b551fd99b/doc/mini-comment.txt#L111) for complex cases.\r\n\r\nCreate a file 'after/ftplugin/blueprint.lua' (or whichever 'filetype' is actually set in your case) and add line `vim.bo.commentstring = '// %s'` to it.",
            "created_at": "2023-06-01T07:35:50Z",
